rac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=-\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}x}.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, equation $(∗)$ can be written as a linear equation in $z(x)$ as follows:\n\n$$\n-\\frac{1}{4}\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}x}-z\\operatorname{tan}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\n$$\n\nFinally, we write the above equation in standard form, which gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}x}+4z\\operatorname{tan}⁡x=-4\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $Q(x)=-4\\operatorname{cos}⁡x$" 13194139534944 true] [17592186321542 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321543 13194139534944 true] [17592186321542 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321544 13194139534944 true] [17592186321542 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321545 13194139534944 true] [17592186321542 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321546 13194139534944 true] [17592186321542 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321547 13194139534944 true] [17592186321542 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534944 true] [17592186321542 1041 "selection" 13194139534944 true] [17592186321542 1104 #edb/ref 17592186321546 13194139534944 true] [17592186321542 1110 #uuid "9406f410-f316-5318-ba6d-d3b4b7823619" 13194139534944 true] [17592186321543 1034 "\\frac{4}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}" 13194139534944 true] [17592186321543 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534944 true] [17592186321543 1111 #uuid "f884247f-c187-5c62-abff-c8b2a433e102" 13194139534944 true] [17592186321544 1034 "\\operatorname{tan}⁡x" 13194139534944 true] [17592186321544 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534944 true] [17592186321544 1111 #uuid "0a938b54-7bb4-5122-b4f3-af821a595a6b" 13194139534944 true] [17592186321545 1034 "\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x" 13194139534944 true] [17592186321545 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534944 true] [17592186321545 1111 #uuid "9fbeaa9c-5c50-5fc0-804a-5e5aa4838165" 13194139534944 true] [17592186321546 1034 "-4\\operatorname{cos}⁡x" 13194139534944 true] [17592186321546 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534944 true] [17592186321546 1111 #uuid "1f7d0b71-b4fb-5475-ae0d-2063b12cd78a" 13194139534944 tr